OL,3,AOwners of Elvis music rights sue
OL,4,AAnthropic for copyright violations
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe owners of the rights to music by
OL,7,FElvis Presley have sued artificial
OL,8,Fintelligence company Anthropic,
OL,9,Fclaiming in court that the company
OL,10,Fviolated copyright law by using Elvis
OL,11,Fmusic to train its AI model Claude.
OL,13,FIn a legal case filed on Friday,
OL,14,FAuthentic Brands Group - which owns the
OL,15,Fmusic - accused Anthropic of using 274
OL,16,FElvis songs without paying for any
OL,17,Flicence.
OL,23,APub: 26-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,172,160,200,105,0,100
