OL,3,AOwners of Elvis music rights sue
OL,4,AAnthropic for copyright violations
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The Elvis Plaintiffs' iconic
OL,7,Fcollective catalog contains some of the
OL,8,Fmost groundbreaking, revolutionary,
OL,9,Finfluential, and enduring musical
OL,10,Fcompositions in human history," the
OL,11,Fcase states.
OL,13,FA spokesperson for Anthropic told BBC
OL,14,FNews: "We disagree with the claims and
OL,15,Fintend to defend this case fully."
